flowchart LR
  Client[HTTP клиент]
  API[api-service]
  SG[semgrep-service]
  GL[gitleaks-service]
  TV[trivy-sca-service]
  ZP[zap-dast-service]
  K[Kafka<br/>asoc.findings.ingest<br/>asoc.findings.ingest.result]
  PR[processing-service]
  RD[reference-data-service]
  JI[jira-integration-service]
  JM[jira-mock]
  DB[(PostgreSQL)]

  Client --> API
  API --> SG
  API --> GL
  API --> TV
  API --> ZP
  API -->|produce ingest| K
  K -->|consume| PR
  PR -->|produce result| K
  K -->|read reply| API
  API -->|GET /groups| PR
  RD -->|sync записи| DB
  PR -->|чтение catalog, запись находок| DB
  API -->|POST /tickets| JI
  JI --> JM
  JI --> DB
